  "body": "The developer has their sights set on the next project, and this property is ready for a new owner.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted, this freehold, standalone four-bedroom, four-bathroom home offers flexibility for both homeowners and investors. With generous accommodation, clever separation across three levels and low-maintenance living close to Auckland City, there's plenty worth exploring.\r\n\r\nThe clever split-level design offers something a little different. Three levels, connected by just half flights of stairs, create natural separation between living and sleeping areas without losing that sense of connection.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll find inside:\r\n\r\n*  Four bedrooms and four bathrooms, including two ground-floor bedrooms with their own ensuites, ideal for teenagers, guests or extended family.\r\n*  A quality kitchen with Miele appliances, separate dining and comfortable living spaces.\r\n*  Flexible additional areas for a home office or study.\r\n*  A private upper-level master suite.\r\n*  Freehold, standalone ownership with easy-care outdoor spaces.\r\n*  Internal-access garage plus off-street parking.\r\n*  Stamford Builders Insurance guarantee for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nWhether you're upsizing, downsizing or simply looking for a home that offers more flexibility, there's plenty here to work with.\r\n\r\nThe developer has their sights set on the next project. This property needs its next owner.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself. You might be surprised by how much is on offer.\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised. All conjunctional agents welcome.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings:\r\n\r\nKristy Chen | 020 4149 0233\r\nAngelina Vihrova | 021 727 751",
